{"page":20109,"part":1,"text":"陈槱\n\n\n陈槱，南宋绍熙年间书法家，陈几之孙，长乐（今属广东）人。生平事迹不详。\n\n\n《负暄野录》二卷，《四库全书总目提要》曰：“旧本题陈槱撰，不著时代，卷末有至正七年王东跋。是书上卷论石刻者五则，其前汉无碑及古碑毁坏两说，未经人道。言篆法一则，谓作篆仍宜用笔尖，持论甚详。言诸家书格者七则。下卷言学书之法者四则，言笔墨纸砚者十二则，俱甚精到。”此书《宋史·艺文志》不为著录。此选自《知不足斋丛书》，录十四则，不分卷次。\n\n\n负暄野录\n","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20109,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"260fabce9b3e9971be55dd891bcf9b2eeeb9f699fbd5a407ebc4266e07d75d45","textSha256":"260fabce9b3e9971be55dd891bcf9b2eeeb9f699fbd5a407ebc4266e07d75d45","fileSha256":"260fabce9b3e9971be55dd891bcf9b2eeeb9f699fbd5a407ebc4266e07d75d45","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20109-work-117.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"负暄野录 · 题解与篇首","sourceUrl":"","originalPages":[385],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":3,"sourceTextSha256":"9ba90c6cfb4dcd2c9e3457e07e3139a959433b57257c3b49f398056fa873f995","id":"local-385-0-9","page_id":385,"origin":"legacy-reviewed-txt","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":9,"reviewedTextSha256":"ff542a04d14a4f4bf41a89917b053984076bca18e6ea5b568a2321577df236ef","displayUnitOrigins":[[6,7],[7,8],[8,9]],"legacySource":{"kind":"human-txt","page":385,"part":2,"label":"人工审核原TXT","verifiedBy":"郑雨荻","verifiedAt":"2026-10-19T12:56:20.474Z","revision":"ff542a04d14a4f4bf41a89917b053984076bca18e6ea5b568a2321577df236ef","textSha256":"ff542a04d14a4f4bf41a89917b053984076bca18e6ea5b568a2321577df236ef","fileSha256":"a7959b8ad3ac4b1328d4afcc5960761834bc9dbc83e2ea2d0c51808b9658a61c","txtPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-逐页校勘.txt","reviewCsvPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-TXT校验表.csv","reviewJsonPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-初筛进度备份.json"}},{"start":5,"end":41,"sourceTextSha256":"f8dd773614e5084961ef23f